    "DefaultText": "Water-Driven Stamp Mill"
  },
  "CardDescription": {
    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_stamp_mill_placed",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_StampMillPlaced_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "Water-driven stamps crush a hopper of ore at once, each piece a little better than by hand."
  },
  "CardHelpSection": {
    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_stamp_mill_placed",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_StampMillPlaced_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Requirements:</b> Water at this location (a river or lake, or a connected mill race outlet).\n\n<b>Hopper:</b> Takes only Greenstone, Greenstone Slag and Bog Iron (fresh, dried or roasted). Tin ore does not go in.\n\n<b>Stamp All:</b> Crushes everything in the hopper (30 minutes) into Greenstone Powder, Greenstone Slag Powder or Crushed Bog Iron, each with the hand hammer's Quality bonus (Greenstone +7, Bog Iron +3, slag +0).\n\n<b>Partner:</b> A recruited Partner can be given an Operate the Stamp Mill duty."
  },
